      "headline": "Birth of Rodney King",
      "text": "Rodney Glen King was born on April 2, 1965, in Sacramento, California.",
      "date": "1965-04-02"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Beating by LAPD",
      "text": "On March 3, 1991, Rodney King was severely beaten by officers of the Los Angeles Police Department (LAPD) during his arrest after a high-speed pursuit for driving while intoxicated on the I-210. The incident was filmed by a bystander, George Holliday, and the footage was sent to local news station KTLA.",
      "date": "1991-03-03"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Broadcast of Beating Footage",
      "text": "The footage of Rodney King's beating was broadcast by KTLA and subsequently picked up by news media around the world, causing a public uproar.",
      "date": "1991-03"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Trial of LAPD Officers",
      "text": "The trial of the LAPD officers involved in the beating of Rodney King began in 1992. The officers were charged with assault with a deadly weapon and use of excessive force.",
      "date": "1992"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Acquittal of LAPD Officers",
      "text": "On April 29, 1992, a jury acquitted three of the LAPD officers and failed to reach a verdict on one charge for the fourth officer. This verdict led to the Los Angeles riots.",
      "date": "1992-04-29"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Los Angeles Riots",
      "text": "Following the acquittal of the LAPD officers, the Los Angeles riots erupted on April 29, 1992, lasting several days and resulting in significant damage and loss of life.",
      "date": "1992-04-29"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Federal Civil Rights Trial",
      "text": "In 1993, a federal civil rights trial was held for the LAPD officers involved in the beating of Rodney King. Two officers were found guilty and sentenced to prison.",
      "date": "1993"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Settlement with City of Los Angeles",
      "text": "In 1994, Rodney King was awarded $3.8 million in a civil lawsuit against the City of Los Angeles.",
      "date": "1994"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Publication of Autobiography",
      "text": "Rodney King published his autobiography, 'The Riot Within: My Journey from Rebellion to Redemption,' in 2012.",
      "date": "2012"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Death of Rodney King",
      "text": "Rodney King died on June 17, 2012, in Rialto, California, at the age of 47.",
      "date": "2012-06-17"
    }
  ]
}

