      "headline": "Caliphate of Umar ibn al-Khattab",
      "text": "Umar ibn al-Khattab became the second caliph in 634 after the death of Abu Bakr. His rule lasted until 644 and is noted for significant expansion of the Islamic empire.",
      "date": "0634"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Caliphate of Uthman ibn Affan",
      "text": "Uthman ibn Affan became the third caliph in 644. His tenure lasted until 656 and was marked by internal dissent and the compilation of the Quran.",
