      "text": "On August 10, 2018, a Horizon Air De Havilland Canada Dash 8-400 was stolen from Seattle–Tacoma International Airport (Sea–Tac) by Richard Russell, a 28-year-old Horizon Air ground service agent with no piloting experience.",
      "date": "2018-08-10"
    },
