      "headline": "Biblical Mention of Sodom and Gomorrah",
      "text": "Sodom and Gomorrah are first mentioned in the Book of Genesis in the Hebrew Bible. They are described as cities in the plain of Jordan, near the Dead Sea, known for their wickedness and sinfulness.",
