      "headline": "Abraham's Plea for Sodom",
      "text": "According to Genesis 18, Abraham pleads with God to spare the city of Sodom if righteous people can be found there. This negotiation highlights the theme of divine justice and mercy.",
      "date": "-2000"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Destruction of Sodom and Gomorrah",
      "text": "In Genesis 19, God destroys Sodom and Gomorrah with fire and brimstone due to their inhabitants' sins. Lot, Abraham's nephew, and his family are spared after being warned by angels to flee the city.",
      "date": "-2000"
    },
