      "text": "A second truce was declared on 18 July 1948, which lasted until 15 October 1948.",
      "date": "1948-07-18"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Operation Yoav",
      "text": "Operation Yoav was launched by Israeli forces on 15 October 1948, breaking the second truce.",
      "date": "1948-10-15"
    },
    {
