      "headline": "First European Sightings",
      "text": "The first recorded European sightings of the Falkland Islands were made by the English navigator John Davis in 1592.",
      "date": "1592"
    },
    {
      "headline": "First Landing",
      "text": "The first recorded landing on the islands was by the English captain John Strong in 1690, who named the sound between the two main islands 'Falkland Sound'.",
      "date": "1690"
