      "headline": "Stanley Cup Becomes NHL Championship Trophy",
      "text": "In 1926, the Stanley Cup was established as the de facto championship trophy of the National Hockey League (NHL), solidifying its status in professional ice hockey.",
      "date": "1926"
    },
