      "text": "Judas Iscariot betrayed Jesus to the Sanhedrin in the Garden of Gethsemane. He identified Jesus to the arresting soldiers by kissing him and addressing him as 'master'. This act of betrayal was in exchange for 30 pieces of silver.",
