    {
      "headline": "Founding of Universal Pictures",
      "text": "Universal Pictures was founded on April 30, 1912, by Carl Laemmle, Mark Dintenfass, Charles O. Baumann, Adam Kessel, Pat Powers, William Swanson, David Horsley, and Jules Brulatour.",
      "date": "1912-04-30"
