      "headline": "Opening of Universal City",
      "text": "On March 15, 1915, Universal City, the world's first self-contained community dedicated to making movies, was officially opened.",
      "date": "1915-03-15"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Introduction of Sound Films",
      "text": "In 1929, Universal Pictures released 'Show Boat', one of the first sound films, marking the studio's transition into the sound era.",
      "date": "1929"
