    },
    {
      "headline": "Release of 'E.T. the Extra-Terrestrial'",
      "text": "In 1982, Universal Pictures released 'E.T. the Extra-Terrestrial', directed by Steven Spielberg, which became one of the highest-grossing films of all time.",
      "date": "1982"
