      "headline": "Reign of Trisong Detsen",
      "text": "Trisong Detsen, who reigned from 755 to 797, was a significant Tibetan emperor known for establishing Buddhism as the state religion and inviting Indian scholars to Tibet.",
      "date": "0755"
    },
