      "headline": "Flight 17 Shot Down",
      "text": "On July 17, 2014, Malaysia Airlines Flight 17 was shot down by a Buk 9M38 surface-to-air missile fired by Russian-backed forces while flying over eastern Ukraine. The aircraft was about 50 kilometers from the Ukraine–Russia border when contact was lost.",
      "date": "2014-07-17"
    },
    {
