      "headline": "Last Recorded Celebration of the Ancient Olympic Games",
      "text": "The last recorded celebration of the ancient Olympic Games was in AD 393, under the emperor Theodosius I.",
      "date": "0393"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Possible End of the Games",
      "text": "The games likely came to an end under Theodosius II, possibly in connection with a fire that burned down the temple of the Olympian Zeus during his reign.",
