      "headline": "Birth of T. E. Lawrence",
      "text": "Thomas Edward Lawrence was born on August 16, 1888, in Tremadog, Caernarfonshire, Wales.",
      "date": "1888-08-16"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Education at Jesus College, Oxford",
      "text": "In 1907, Lawrence began his studies at Jesus College, Oxford, where he read History.",
