      "text": "On October 11, 1776, Arnold fought in the Battle of Valcour Island on Lake Champlain, delaying the British advance.",
      "date": "1776-10-11"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Battle of Saratoga",
      "text": "Arnold played a crucial role in the American victory at the Battle of Saratoga in October 1777, which was a turning point in the Revolutionary War.",
      "date": "1777-10"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Appointed Commander of Philadelphia",
      "text": "In 1778, Arnold was appointed as the military commander of Philadelphia.",
      "date": "1778"
    },
