      "headline": "Marriage to Peggy Shippen",
      "text": "On April 8, 1779, Arnold married Peggy Shippen, a Loyalist sympathizer.",
      "date": "1779-04-08"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Command of West Point",
      "text": "In August 1780, Arnold was given command of the American fort at West Point, New York.",
      "date": "1780-08"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Defection to the British",
      "text": "In September 1780, Arnold's plot to surrender West Point to the British was discovered, and he defected to the British side.",
