      "headline": "Legal Challenges Begin",
      "text": "In 2000, the Chagossians won a legal victory in the British High Court, which ruled that their expulsion was unlawful. However, subsequent legal and political challenges have continued.",
      "date": "2000"
    },
    {
      "headline": "International Court of Justice Ruling",
      "text": "On February 25, 2019, the International Court of Justice ruled that the United Kingdom should end its administration of the Chagos Archipelago and return it to Mauritius.",
