    },
    {
      "headline": "Lindbergh Kidnapping",
      "text": "On March 1, 1932, Charles Lindbergh's 20-month-old son, Charles Jr., was kidnapped from their home in New Jersey. The event led to a nationwide search and was widely covered by the media.",
