      "text": "In the 16th century, the Safavid dynasty of Persia established control over parts of Dagestan.",
      "date": "1500"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Russian Expansion",
      "text": "In the 18th century, the Russian Empire began expanding into the Caucasus, including Dagestan.",
      "date": "1722"
    },
    {
