      "headline": "2010 Military Coup",
      "text": "In February 2010, a military coup ousted President Tandja, leading to the suspension of the constitution and the establishment of a military junta.",
      "date": "2010-02"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Return to Democracy",
      "text": "In 2011, Niger returned to democratic rule with the election of Mahamadou Issoufou as president.",
