      "headline": "First Use of the Term 'Asexuality'",
      "text": "The term 'asexuality' was first used in the early 20th century to describe a lack of sexual attraction to others. It began to gain more recognition as a distinct sexual orientation in the late 20th and early 21st centuries.",
