      "headline": "Establishment of New Orleans",
      "text": "In 1718, the city of New Orleans was founded by the French Mississippi Company, under the direction of Jean-Baptiste Le Moyne de Bienville.",
      "date": "1718"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Transfer to Spain",
      "text": "In 1762, the Treaty of Fontainebleau secretly ceded Louisiana from France to Spain.",
