      "headline": "Louisiana Purchase",
      "text": "On April 30, 1803, the United States purchased the Louisiana Territory from France, doubling the size of the U.S.",
      "date": "1803-04-30"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Statehood",
      "text": "On April 30, 1812, Louisiana was admitted to the Union as the 18th state.",
      "date": "1812-04-30"
    },
