    },
    {
      "headline": "Resolution of the Crisis",
      "text": "The Cuban Missile Crisis was resolved on October 28, 1962, when Soviet Premier Nikita Khrushchev agreed to dismantle the missile sites in Cuba in exchange for a U.S. promise not to invade Cuba and the secret removal of U.S. missiles from Turkey.",
      "date": "1962-10-28"
