      "headline": "Creation of the Dow Jones Industrial Average",
      "text": "The Dow Jones Industrial Average (DJIA) was created by Charles Dow, co-founder of Dow Jones & Company, and first published on May 26, 1896. It initially included 12 companies.",
      "date": "1896-05-26"
    },
