      "text": "On December 17, 2010, Mohamed Bouazizi, a Tunisian street vendor, set himself on fire in protest of police corruption and ill-treatment. This act became a catalyst for the Tunisian Revolution and the wider Arab Spring.",
      "date": "2010-12-17"
