    },
    {
      "headline": "Crash in Pennsylvania",
      "text": "At 10:03 AM, United Airlines Flight 93 crashed into a field in Somerset County, Pennsylvania, as a result of the passengers' attempt to thwart the hijackers' plans. All 44 passengers and crew aboard were killed.",
