    {
      "headline": "Richard von Krafft-Ebing's 'Psychopathia Sexualis'",
      "text": "In 1886, Richard von Krafft-Ebing published 'Psychopathia Sexualis', a seminal work in the field of sexology that introduced the terms 'sadism' and 'masochism' to a wider audience.",
      "date": "1886"
