      "text": "In 1989, Dr. Nils Rydbeck, CTO of Ericsson Mobile in Lund, Sweden, tasked Jaap Haartsen with developing a short-link radio technology to create a wireless headset. This marked the conceptual beginning of Bluetooth technology.",
      "date": "1989"
