      "text": "In June 2010, Bluetooth 4.0 was released, featuring Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE) for low power consumption, which was ideal for devices like fitness trackers.",
      "date": "2010-06"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Bluetooth 5.0 Release",
      "text": "In December 2016, Bluetooth 5.0 was released, offering increased range, speed, and broadcast messaging capacity, enhancing its application in IoT devices.",
      "date": "2016-12"
    },
