      "headline": "Birth of Mehmed II",
      "text": "Mehmed II was born on March 30, 1432, in Edirne, the then-capital of the Ottoman Empire.",
      "date": "1432-03-30"
    },
    {
      "headline": "First Reign as Sultan",
      "text": "Mehmed II ascended to the throne for the first time on August 1444, following the abdication of his father, Sultan Murad II.",
      "date": "1444-08"
