      "date": "1969-08-17"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Final Day of Woodstock Festival",
      "text": "The festival concluded on August 18, 1969, with performances by Crosby, Stills, Nash & Young, and Jimi Hendrix, who played an iconic rendition of 'The Star-Spangled Banner'.",
      "date": "1969-08-18"
