      "text": "The Nationalist Congress Party (NCP) was formed on June 10, 1999, by Sharad Pawar, P. A. Sangma, and Tariq Anwar after they were expelled from the Indian National Congress for disputing the right of Italian-born Sonia Gandhi to lead the party.",
