      "text": "In 2012, Samuel Little was arrested at a homeless shelter in Louisville, Kentucky, and extradited to Los Angeles, California, on a narcotics charge.",
      "date": "2012"
    },
    {
      "headline": "DNA Match and Murder Charges",
      "text": "In 2013, DNA evidence linked Samuel Little to three cold case murders in Los Angeles, leading to murder charges.",
      "date": "2013"
