      "headline": "Birth of Wernher von Braun",
      "text": "Wernher von Braun was born on March 23, 1912, in Wirsitz, Province of Posen, German Empire (now Wyrzysk, Poland).",
      "date": "1912-03-23"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Joins the Verein für Raumschiffahrt",
      "text": "In 1930, von Braun joined the Verein für Raumschiffahrt (VfR, 'Spaceflight Society'), an amateur rocket group that was one of the first to experiment with liquid-fueled rockets.",
      "date": "1930"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Graduates with a degree in Mechanical Engineering",
      "text": "In 1932, von Braun graduated from the Technical University of Berlin with a degree in mechanical engineering.",
      "date": "1932"
