      "headline": "Discovery of the Rosetta Stone",
      "text": "The Rosetta Stone was discovered in 1799 by French soldiers who were rebuilding a fort in Egypt. It was found in the town of Rashid (Rosetta) in the Nile Delta.",
      "date": "1799"
