      "headline": "Arrival at the British Museum",
      "text": "The Rosetta Stone was transported to England and arrived at the British Museum in 1802, where it has been on public display ever since.",
      "date": "1802"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Decipherment of Egyptian scripts",
      "text": "The Rosetta Stone played a crucial role in the decipherment of Egyptian hieroglyphs. In 1822, Jean-François Champollion announced his success in deciphering the hieroglyphs, using the Greek text on the Rosetta Stone as a key.",
      "date": "1822"
    }
  ]
}

