      "text": "Charlotte was founded in 1768 and named after Charlotte of Mecklenburg-Strelitz, the queen consort of King George III of Great Britain.",
      "date": "1768"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Incorporation as a Town",
      "text": "Charlotte was incorporated as a town in 1768, the same year it was founded.",
