      "headline": "AIPAC's Role in U.S.-Israel Relations",
      "text": "Throughout the 1990s and 2000s, AIPAC played a crucial role in strengthening U.S.-Israel relations, advocating for military aid and strategic cooperation.",
      "date": "1990"
    },
