      "text": "Artur Gustav Martin Phleps was born on 1881-11-29 in Biertan, Transylvania, which was then part of the Austro-Hungarian Empire.",
      "date": "1881-11-29"
    },
    {
      "headline": "World War I Service",
      "text": "During World War I, Phleps served as an officer in the Austro-Hungarian Army, specializing in mountain warfare and logistics. By the end of the war in 1918, he had been promoted to the rank of Oberstleutnant.",
      "date": "1918"
