      "text": "The Battle of Kursk began on July 5, 1943, with a massive German offensive aimed at encircling Soviet forces in the Kursk salient.",
      "date": "1943-07-05"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Operation Citadel",
      "text": "Operation Citadel was the German codename for their offensive at Kursk, which commenced on July 5, 1943. It was intended to pinch off the Kursk salient with attacks on the northern and southern flanks.",
