      "headline": "Constitution of India Comes into Effect",
      "text": "On January 26, 1950, the Constitution of India came into effect, establishing the Parliament of India as the supreme legislative body of the Republic of India.",
      "date": "1950-01-26"
    },
    {
      "headline": "First General Elections",
      "text": "The first general elections in India were held between October 25, 1951, and February 21, 1952, marking the formation of the first Lok Sabha.",
