      "text": "In the late 16th century, Japan was in a state of civil war known as the Sengoku period. After the death of Toyotomi Hideyoshi in 1598, a power struggle ensued between the Toyotomi loyalists and the Tokugawa faction, leading to the Battle of Sekigahara.",
