      "headline": "The Battle of Sekigahara",
      "text": "The Battle of Sekigahara took place on October 21, 1600. It was a decisive battle between the Eastern Army under Tokugawa Ieyasu and the Western Army under Ishida Mitsunari. The battle resulted in a victory for Tokugawa Ieyasu.",
      "date": "1600-10-21"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Aftermath of the Battle",
      "text": "Following the victory at Sekigahara, Tokugawa Ieyasu consolidated power, leading to the establishment of the Tokugawa shogunate in 1603, which ruled Japan for over 250 years.",
