      "headline": "Industrial Rise of the Rust Belt",
      "text": "From the late 19th century to the late 20th century, the region now known as the Rust Belt formed the industrial heartland of the United States. Its economies were largely based on steel and automobile production, coal mining, and the processing of raw materials.",
