    {
      "headline": "Formation of the United States Army Special Forces",
      "text": "The United States Army Special Forces, known as the Green Berets, were officially formed on June 19, 1952. The unit was established to conduct unconventional warfare, foreign internal defense, direct action, and counter-terrorism missions.",
      "date": "1952-06-19"
    },
