      "headline": "Introduction of the M1911A1",
      "text": "In 1926, the improved M1911A1 model was introduced. It featured several design changes, including a shorter trigger, a cutout in the frame behind the trigger, an arched mainspring housing, a longer grip safety spur, and simplified grip checkering.",
