      "text": "Jesus was crucified, and his apostles were witnesses to his death and resurrection. This event is central to Christian belief and is dated to around 30-33 AD.",
      "date": "0030"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Great Commission",
      "text": "After his resurrection, Jesus appeared to his apostles and gave them the Great Commission to spread his teachings to all nations. This event is described in the Gospels and is dated to shortly after the resurrection, around 30-33 AD.",
      "date": "0030"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Pentecost",
      "text": "The apostles received the Holy Spirit on the day of Pentecost, empowering them to begin their ministry. This event is described in the Acts of the Apostles and is dated to 50 days after the resurrection, around 30-33 AD.",
      "date": "0030"
    },
    {
