      "text": "In 1981, the Reagan administration began secretly facilitating the sale of arms to Iran, despite an arms embargo.",
      "date": "1981"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Boland Amendment Passed",
      "text": "In 1982, the U.S. Congress passed the Boland Amendment, which prohibited further U.S. government funding of the Contras in Nicaragua.",
