      "date": "1989-05-04"
    },
    {
      "headline": "George H.W. Bush Pardons Key Figures",
      "text": "On December 24, 1992, President George H.W. Bush pardoned six individuals involved in the Iran-Contra affair, including Caspar Weinberger.",
