      "headline": "Formation of Islamic State – Khorasan Province",
      "text": "The Islamic State – Khorasan Province (ISKP) was officially formed in January 2015. It was established as a regional branch of the Islamic State (IS), aiming to expand IS's influence in South-Central Asia, primarily Afghanistan and Pakistan.",
      "date": "2015-01"
    },
    {
      "headline": "First Major Attack",
