    },
    {
      "headline": "Introduction of the Comics Code Authority",
      "text": "In 1954, the Comics Code Authority was established, leading to self-censorship in the comic book industry.",
      "date": "1954"
    },
    {
      "headline": "The Silver Age of Comics Begins",
      "text": "The Silver Age of Comics began in 1956 with the introduction of a new version of The Flash in Showcase #4.",
