      "text": "Alaska Airlines Flight 261 departed from Licenciado Gustavo Díaz Ordaz International Airport in Puerto Vallarta, Jalisco, Mexico, on January 31, 2000. The flight was scheduled to stop at San Francisco International Airport before continuing to Seattle–Tacoma International Airport.",
      "date": "2000-01-31"
