      "date": "2021-05-17"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Oral Arguments Heard by Supreme Court",
      "text": "On December 1, 2021, the U.S. Supreme Court heard oral arguments in Dobbs v. Jackson Women's Health Organization.",
      "date": "2021-12-01"
    },
