      "headline": "Guernica in the United States",
      "text": "In 1939, Guernica was sent to the United States, where it was exhibited at the Museum of Modern Art (MoMA) in New York.",
      "date": "1939"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Return to Spain",
      "text": "In 1981, Guernica was returned to Spain and placed in the Casón del Buen Retiro in Madrid.",
