      "text": "LiveLeak played a significant role during the Arab Spring by hosting videos from protests and uprisings across the Middle East, providing a platform for citizen journalists to share footage with the world.",
      "date": "2010-2011"
    },
    {
      "headline": "LiveLeak's Role in the Syrian Civil War",
      "text": "Throughout the Syrian Civil War, LiveLeak was used to share graphic footage from the conflict, including videos from both sides of the war, which were often not available through traditional media outlets.",
      "date": "2011-2019"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Closure of LiveLeak",
