      "headline": "Nobel Prize in Physics",
      "text": "In 2013, the Nobel Prize in Physics was awarded to François Englert and Peter Higgs for the theoretical discovery of a mechanism that contributes to our understanding of the origin of mass of subatomic particles, and which recently was confirmed through the discovery of the predicted fundamental particle, by the ATLAS and CMS experiments at CERN's Large Hadron Collider.",
      "date": "2013"
    },
