      "headline": "Reconstruction by Maharaja Ranjit Singh",
      "text": "In the early 19th century, Maharaja Ranjit Singh rebuilt the temple with marble and copper and overlaid the sanctum with gold foil, giving it its distinctive appearance.",
      "date": "1800"
