      "text": "According to Islamic tradition, Jesus (known as 'Isa in Arabic) was born to the Virgin Mary (Maryam) through a miraculous birth without a father. The Quran states that Mary was chosen above all women and that Jesus's birth was a sign from God. This event is believed to have occurred in Bethlehem, though the exact date is not specified in Islamic texts.",
