      "headline": "Nobel Prize in Physiology or Medicine",
      "text": "In 1979, Sir Godfrey Hounsfield and Dr. Allan Cormack were awarded the Nobel Prize in Physiology or Medicine for their contributions to the development of computed tomography.",
      "date": "1979"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Introduction of Spiral CT",
      "text": "Spiral (or helical) CT was introduced in the late 1980s, allowing for faster and more detailed imaging.",
      "date": "1989"
    },
