      "text": "A third group of attackers carried out a mass shooting and took hostages at an Eagles of Death Metal concert at the Bataclan theatre, attended by 1,500 people. This led to a stand-off with police.",
      "date": "2015-11-13"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Police Raid on Bataclan",
      "text": "The attackers at the Bataclan theatre were either shot by police or detonated suicide vests when police raided the theatre.",
      "date": "2015-11-13"
    },
