      "headline": "Formation of British Airways",
      "text": "British Airways was formed in 1974 as a result of a merger between four companies: British Overseas Airways Corporation (BOAC), British European Airways (BEA), Cambrian Airways, and Northeast Airlines.",
      "date": "1974"
