      "headline": "Privatization of British Airways",
      "text": "British Airways was privatized in February 1987, marking a significant change in its operations and ownership structure.",
      "date": "1987-02"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Merger with Iberia",
      "text": "In January 2011, British Airways merged with Iberia, the flag carrier airline of Spain, to form the International Airlines Group (IAG), one of the world's largest airline groups.",
      "date": "2011-01"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Introduction of the Airbus A380",
      "text": "British Airways introduced the Airbus A380 into its fleet in 2013, enhancing its long-haul flight capabilities.",
      "date": "2013"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Centenary Celebrations",
      "text": "In 2019, British Airways celebrated its 100th anniversary, marking a century since the airline's predecessor companies began operations.",
      "date": "2019"
    }
  ]
}

