      "headline": "Birth of Alexander I",
      "text": "Alexander I was born on December 23, 1777, in Saint Petersburg, Russia.",
      "date": "1777-12-23"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Ascension to the Throne",
      "text": "Alexander I became Emperor of Russia on March 23, 1801, following the assassination of his father, Emperor Paul I.",
      "date": "1801-03-23"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Treaty of Tilsit",
      "text": "In July 1807, Alexander I signed the Treaty of Tilsit with Napoleon, which marked a temporary peace between Russia and France.",
